below before merging.\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Read before merging**\n> - **Breaking** (`lib`): the old timeout flag is gone.\n> - **Check the bump** (`lib`): Marked Breaking, but this change bumps only `minor`; a breaking change needs `major`.\n> - **Changed, not releasing** (`app`): Source changed since the last release, but this release does not include them. Add a changeset if the changes should ship.\n\n### 📦 What's Changing\n\n**1 change(s) across 1 package(s):**\n\n#### 🟡 Minor\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>Add a retry option.</b> — affects <code>lib</code></summary>\n\nBreaking: the old timeout flag is gone.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>Release Workflow Instructions</b></summary>\n\n- **Merging this PR**: Merging into `main` will automatically publish all updated packages to their release registries.\n- **Adding more changesets**: If additional changesets are pushed to `main`, Callisto will automatically re-calculate and update this PR.\n- **Manual edits**: You can make manual adjustments directly on the `release` branch if needed.\n\n</details>\n=== changelog\n# lib\n\n## 1.1.0\n\n_2026-11-09_\n\n### Minor Changes\n\n- Add a retry option.\n\n  Breaking: the old timeout flag is gone.\n\ndir: /var/folders/q1/qkn6792j1c3cxt6vjd88tlc00000gn/T/tmp.y54cyo8h1P","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4ae3c588-9fe6-4254-bef2-0f80a6583a00","timestamp":"2026-11-09T21:00:44.712Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== init\nDetected:\n  ecosystems: cargo\n  origin: none\n  packages:\n    cargo/app 1.0.0 (last tag: none; binary: app)\n    cargo/lib 1.0.0 (last tag: none)\nNo `origin` remote is configured: skipping the release workflow and shipping-binaries questions; `callisto release` will refuse until one is added.\n\ncallisto.toml: no settings needed, the defaults apply.\nFirst release preview (`callisto release --dry-run`):\nRelease plan:\n  cargo/app 1.0.0\n    - publish to crates.io\n    - create git tag\n  cargo/lib 1.0.0\n    - publish to crates.io\n    - create git tag\nnote