{"parentUuid":"813b8116-7429-499d-9e1e-88e361e37e93","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgt39C4FsdqCt6HuVUH5q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LWyKnW3XBx8u87apcViXKy","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr485.md","content":"## Summary\n\nA new project's first release PR said **Changed, not releasing** for every package it did not change, \"Source changed since the last release\". A package that has never been released has no tag and no last release, so nothing can have changed since it, and every untagged package counted as changed.\n\n- The unreleased-changes finding now skips packages with no tag. Tagged packages behave as before.\n\nFound by running `init`, `add`, `version` and `compose-pr-body` on a fresh two-crate repo the way a new user would.\n\n## Verify\n\n- New end-to-end test: a never-released package gives no unreleased entry; without the tag filter it fails. The existing test now tags the package it expects to see flagged, so it covers a released package with a later change.\n- `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0.\n\nNot run: CI. This touches one paragraph of `docs/architecture/versioning.md` that #483 also edits, so whichever merges second needs a one-line doc rebase.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":339,"cache_read_input_tokens":287933,"output_tokens":810,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":62},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":339,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":810,"cache_read_input_tokens":287933,"cache_creation_input_tokens":339,"cache_creation":{"e